WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.530
Hey there, miss.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.280
Care to stop for a sip of tea?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.030
A pretty girl like you

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.110
will always be welcome at our 
Mad Tea Club's tea parties!

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.200
They appeared just as
we entered the Story Zone...

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.020
Who are they?

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:21.250
I get it. This is what they call a "pickup."

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.960
The boss is super popular.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.590
She gets guys like this all the time...

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.330
Hold it, you two!

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.040
You're under arrest for violating decency laws!

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:34.750
That's...

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.550
Alice!

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.640
What do we do?

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.100
Wait a second!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.280
I've always loved Alice in Wonderland!

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.700
I'm a huge, huge, huge fan of yours!

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.870
So this is the Wonderland Story Zone, huh?

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.240
Wonderland?

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.910
No, there's no wonder here.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:03.400
If I see any, I arrest it!

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.780
We detain all the wonder, madness, 
and indecency in this world!

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:13.210
That's our job as the 
Disciplinarians of Maidenhood,

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:18.000
or DOMs for short!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.770
Reina in Wonderland

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:55.150
So, Mad Hatter and March Hare!

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.760
You're under...

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.410
They're gone?

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:03.270
Now then, you're part of the 
Mad Tea Club, too, aren't you?

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.530
No, of course not...

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.360
Don't lie to me!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.860
This is getting messy.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:12.010
Should we split?

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.630
Reina, we should go, too...

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.450
But...

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:17.770
Reina!

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.430
That was close.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:27.510
But I finally got to meet Alice!

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:32.050
What was the deal with those dumbs, though?

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:35.060
They're not dumbs, they're DOMs.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.910
Yes, that's right!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.730
The Disciplinarians of Maidenhood!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:41.440
You!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.790
Are you the Mad Hatter and March Hare?

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.900
Sure are!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:50.400
Then, if you could, would you tell me more?

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.000
Everyone used to be free.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.960
Free to party! Free to cry!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:01.320
There was only one rule: 
don't try to find meaning in anything.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.590
But now...

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.860
"Can't do this! Can't do that!"

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.420
This Alice is nuts.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.640
Nuts...?

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:14.920
Anyway, let's all have a tea party!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.070
Lots to drink and lots of fun to be had!

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.550
I'll pass.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.640
Now, don't be like that...

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.320
I refuse.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:28.230
I'm afraid if we don't hurry, 
Alice will find us again.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.300
You're right.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.880
But come find us if you 
ever change your minds!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.120
We'd be happy to have you!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.470
See you!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.180
Good grief...

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:41.010
Who's the nutty one here?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:45.780
Say, Reina, you know all about 
Alice in Wonderland right?

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:46.770
Yes...

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:53.210
Once upon a time, 
there lived a girl named Alice.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.480
She loved to imagine things

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.690
because the books her sister 
read her bored her to tears.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:03.120
One day, she heard a strange voice...

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.400
"Oh, no! I'm late! I'm late!"

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:11.470
It was a rabbit wearing clothes
 and holding a pocket watch!

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:15.910
Amazed, Alice ran after the rabbit...

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.220
and ended up falling into a hole.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.540
After falling through the hole,

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:25.490
she found a strange land that 
no one had ever seen before!

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:30.220
From there, she goes
 on a fantastical adventure.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:35.180
But there's nothing in it about 
starting some order or arresting wonders.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.470
So where did things go wrong?

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:42.220
Is it possible that Alice, the main character,
 is actually the Chaos Teller?

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:43.410
There's no way!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:47.100
I didn't sense a Chaos Teller even
 when I was right in front of her.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.840
My bad...

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.150
I guess we'll just have 
to trust your intuition.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:54.860
But at this rate, we'll never get anywhere.

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:57.750
Let's go see Alice, then.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.640
We might learn something.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.160
Y-You're right!

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.130
I'm sure she has a good reason!

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:04.900
Then it's settled!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:09.170
Let's go find the, uh... the dames!

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:12.500
Brother Tao, if you're getting it <i>that</i> wrong...

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.550
I'm afraid you might truly be an idiot.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.170
Please, have mercy!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.260
He was just tired and spacing out!

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:23.860
No! A lapse in concentration 
is a lapse in discipline!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.150
And then those little lapses 
add up to spell chaos!

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.750
Right, vice-captain?

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.690
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:34.360
Daydreaming about anything other than work 
during working hours is forbidden!

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:37.250
So says article 233 of the new law code!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.960
Then it's time for the naughty child's trial.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.170
Please, anything but a trial!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.660
The rules are the rules.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.580
You're not allowed to joke like that, Alice!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.960
You!

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.270
Did you come to interrupt our work again?

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:55.190
No, I came to get back the real you.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:59.210
We are true ladies, 
chosen by the Queen of Hearts.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.890
We're not children obsessed 
with fantasy and wonderment.

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:06.070
The grown-up lady you see 
before you <i>is</i> the real me!

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.520
Grown-up lady, huh?

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:15.030
I don't think grown-up ladies take 
bites from strange cakes to grow big.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:15.900
Twitch!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:20.240
Or ignore their elder sisters to chase 
after rabbits and tumble down holes.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.970
Or try to make their cats say hello.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:24.250
Twitch, twitch!

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:28.000
Or cry entire oceans.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.750
Twitch, twitch, twitch!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.390
For a lady, you're quite the tomboy.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:38.310
H-How did you know about 
my secret past? My dark history?

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.210
I know all about you!

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:45.780
Shall I tell everyone about it right here?

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:49.440
Stop it!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.270
Captain!

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.860
Alice is scared...

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:57.130
Everybody has parts of their past
 they want to keep secret.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:58.790
Come on!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.430
And now, what you've all been waiting for!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.120
The Mad Tea Club!

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:09.830
We're inviting Captain Alice to our party!

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.590
The captain was kidnapped!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.620
I need to hurry and tell the queen!

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:19.640
Queen?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:23.010
Forget that! We need to chase after Alice!

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:26.690
Please wait!

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.110
I don't see Alice!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.860
Did they carry her off somewhere already?

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.970
If you want to know, catch me!

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.360
Hold it right there!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.030
We don't have time to waste playing tag.

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.200
Now answer me. Where is Alice?

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.460
Congratulations on catching me,

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:53.170
but the Mad Tea Club respects 
the privacy of its members.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.620
If that's how you feel, then... Shane.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.970
I'm on it.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.310
Wh-What is this?

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:03.800
Torture won't...

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:04.940
Here I go.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.650
Onigashima-Style Shiatsu Technique!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:20.080
N-Not there... Anywhere but there!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.630
Again!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.000
What was that?!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.570
By stimulating the body's pressure points,

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:33.060
I can provide overwhelming pleasure 
that drains one's will to fight.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:37.890
It's the secret Onigashima-style shiatsu!

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.460
Now, out with it.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:40.770
Where's Alice?

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.340
K-Kill me if you want...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.270
The Mad Tea Club will never...

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:53.560
I'll take you there... Yeah...

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.680
You should've just said that from the start!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.840
This is our hideout!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.700
Hey, March Hare!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:16.180
I can't take it anymore!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.160
What happened?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.760
I was trying to have a super fun tea party!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.220
But she refused to drink my tea

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.810
and just went deeper and 
deeper into the caves!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.690
What's wrong with the tea?

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:36.940
This looks like someone took all 
the despair in the world and distilled it.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.330
What is this?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:42.070
It's super-duper cutting-edge tea
 I got from the caterpillar!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.000
Why'd you give her something like that?

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.400
Why?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.670
Because we're the Mad Tea Club!

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:49.960
Yay!

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.450
I can't take any more...

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.190
What's that girl's problem?

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.580
She tried to make me drink 
that weird stuff...

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.150
I'm not like them.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:04.500
I'm a down-to-earth, grown-up lady.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.370
I'm not some daydreaming little girl anymore.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.210
No, you're still a dreamer.

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:12.880
And a wonderful one!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.100
You... What are you doing here?

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.620
Please, call me Reina.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.860
And this is Ex, Tao, and Shane.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.120
We came to save you.

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.250
Reina...

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.450
You seem to know me well, but how?

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.420
Why are you trying to save me?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.710
This might not make any sense,

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:41.540
but when I was young, your story saved me.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:42.650
My story?

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:46.790
Is what you're doing now 
really what you want to be doing?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:51.890
Weren't you granted a fate 
with all sorts of exciting adventures?

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.110
Adventures are stupid.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:58.150
I'm done with that stuff.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.270
Grown-up ladies don't do things like that.

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:04.170
Why force yourself to be grown-up?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:10.180
Hey, why don't we chat over some snacks 
instead of in this tiny, dark cave?

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:11.530
But...

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:15.020
Don't worry. I'll make sure it's real food.

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:18.510
If we're going to eat something...
I want to have cookies!

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:21.040
Can you make me lots of yummy cookies?

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:22.890
Yes, of course!

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:29.520
A fairy godmother who creates 
a pumpkin carriage?

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.640
There are worlds like that outside?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.600
That's right!

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.340
And there's more than just pumpkin carriages!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:37.440
Scary wolves, and pirates, and treasure!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.780
And windmill giants!

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.410
I've fought all kinds of things.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:43.240
Wow!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.210
Tell me more, tell me more!

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:46.910
Let's see...

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:51.530
There was also the story of the Snow Queen 
who lives in a palace made of ice.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.800
Wow, I'd love to hear about that!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:57.380
Before that, is the next 
batch of cookies ready yet?

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.300
Coming right up...

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.510
Why do we have to do this?

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.410
Alice has really opened up to her, huh?

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:07.220
Now if we could just find
 a lead on the Chaos Teller...

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.180
You're surrounded!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.300
Give yourselves up peacefully!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.100
What's going on?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.630
I finally found you, you indecents!

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.900
White Rabbit!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.390
There you are, captain!

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.650
Now let's arrest these people and go back!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.710
You managed to catch them all at once!

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.440
I-I...

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:33.660
Don't tell me they've 
drawn you to the dark side!

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:37.170
Listen, White Rabbit! 
They're not bad people...

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.960
I'm sure we can all get along!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.210
Forget that!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:45.680
You're not the captain of the 
Disciplinarians of Maidenhood anymore!

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:48.430
And I'm placing you under arrest!

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:52.510
Capture these indecents 
as well as the former captain.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.230
I won't stand for that!

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:55.830
We won't let you take Alice!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.060
We're pretty strong, you know.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:02.770
You must want a taste of
 Onigashima-style shiatsu, too.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.900
F-Fine, I'll just...

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.650
You'll just what?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.370
I've apprehended a leader 
of the Mad Tea Club,

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.380
so I'll let you go for today!

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.380
I don't want to go on trial!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.370
Save me!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.630
The Mad Hatter!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.300
What's he saying about a trial?

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:33.200
He'll go on trial before
 the terrifying Queen of Hearts!

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.060
And her sentences are all the same—death!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.180
Death?

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:39.090
Where are these trials held?

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.330
The Queen of Hearts' castle.

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.430
But you can't go there.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:46.520
There's a special path that 
only the chosen can follow.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:48.990
I'll take you there.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:49.730
Alice?

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:54.240
Alice! Thank you!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.490
You should thank them instead.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:01.030
I'm just returning the favor
 for the yummy cookies.

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.030
Thank you, Alice!

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.510
The sky...

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.180
Yeah. That's bad news.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.150
This way!

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:12.310
They won't see if we go in here!

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:15.010
The courtroom's on the other side of the door?

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:15.640
Yes...

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:18.590
Is the Queen of Hearts 
the Chaos Teller in the end?

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:20.680
Well, we're about to find out.

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:22.040
Let's get going!

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.640
I'm all set.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.810
Ready, and...

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.950
Looks like nobody's home.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.230
What's going on?

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.720
This.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.870
These are...

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.710
Your bailiffs look pretty nasty.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.630
Good work, captain!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.000
Not only did you let them catch 
you to find their hideout,

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.880
you brought all of the indecents right to us!

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.630
What a smart plan!

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:57.710
Plan?

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:59.850
Now do you understand, Reina?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.650
The fantastical adventures you told 
me about were interesting,

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:05.350
but they're pointless.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:06.530
Indeed!

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.110
Well done, Alice!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:13.130
I was right to make you captain.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:17.000
Thank you, Queen of Hearts!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.590
So the queen really is...

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.170
The Chaos Teller?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:21.160
Well?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.560
Dreams, fantasies, stories...

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:27.450
With those occupying your head, 
you'll never be a grown-up lady.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.750
You need to open your eyes!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:31.770
Alice, you...

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:35.290
You've had your head in the clouds ever 
since you heard those stories as a child,

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.230
indulging yourself in fantastic nonsense!

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:41.070
You're still just a tiny, helpless child!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.480
That's not right, Alice.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.080
It's not?

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:49.990
If that's how you feel, then you 
underestimate the power of stories.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.860
The power of stories?

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.490
The wonder, the madness...

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.690
Don't be fooled, Alice!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:01.970
It's strange to hear that from a 
Chaos Teller spreading entropy!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.210
Entropy?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.060
Don't be stupid.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:08.250
I just want everything in order.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.140
That's a fool's way of thinking!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.120
What?

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:13.510
You've long gone mad.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.100
Do you really think you could 
put everything in order?

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.720
Silence, you!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.760
I am the ruler of this world!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:23.730
I have the right to judge it...

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:27.740
And I sentence you all to death!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.670
Their punishment has been declared!

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.600
Get to it, everyone!

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.840
I'll show you, Alice!

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:39.060
The adventures I told you of 
aren't just fantastic nonsense.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:44.070
And the heroic souls we bear won't 
be defeated by the likes of you!

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:45.280
Snow White!

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:47.910
John Silver!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:49.680
Red Riding Hood!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.320
Cinderella!

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.330
Connect!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.330
Th-They just look different now!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.040
Get them, men!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.450
Punishment time!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.660
Beware the Wolf!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.410
They're too strong!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:26.310
Don't let this foolery scare you!

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.630
Queen of Hearts!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.850
From here...

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:34.120
...you'll be facing us!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.160
Silence, little girls!

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.460
This won't stop us!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:42.690
Come, now!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:46.180
I may be little, but I can still fight!

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.690
We won't lose to peril!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:51.810
Then what about this?

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.500
Now do you understand?

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:06.010
Dreams and fantasies will never 
be stronger than reality.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:09.340
That's not true...

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:11.080
Our dreams...

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.120
...won't fail us!

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:13.390
Jeanne d'Arc!

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:14.290
Alice!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.500
Connect!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:26.630
Is that me?

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:28.760
Justice is on our side!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.330
You haven't won yet!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:33.970
Try this!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.800
Repent your sins!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:43.560
Miracle of Orléans!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:48.960
I'll show you your true power!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:53.370
Wonder Labyrinth!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.640
You stupid... little girls...

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:13.570
So this is... the real power of stories?

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:17.370
I thought that I couldn't stay a weak little 
girl who sought refuge in fantasy...

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:20.030
That I need to fight for what was real.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.740
So I arrested all the wonders and mysteries...

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.440
What's wrong with seeking refuge in fantasy?

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:30.700
I loved hearing about 
your adventures in Wonderland

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.600
because they didn't have any 
"lessons" to learn in them!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:37.680
And that wonderment is what led me here!

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.170
With my friends!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:45.180
Maybe I never really understood 
what I was supposed to be fighting...

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.850
Don't worry, Alice.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:50.720
You can start over. 
Go on your own adventures!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:55.940
I'm sure that, to you, meeting us
 will feel like it was all just a dream.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:02.660
But I won't forget that I met you.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:03.870
Not ever.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:07.610
Goodbye, Alice.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.620
Wait, Reina!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.910
There's so much more I want 
to talk to you about...

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:18.290
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:22.710
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:36.590
The queen disappeared?

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.680
What was that?

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.020
Did you do it, Reina?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:42.810
Alice... how do you remember me?

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:44.950
The tuning didn't work?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.600
And the reason the 
Queen of Hearts disappeared is...

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.220
This doesn't make sense.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:53.120
Well done, Priestess of Tuning
 and her companions.

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:59.270
What's his problem?

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:01.040
Something's wrong...

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:05.120
Now, this concludes the story of Wonderland.

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:09.610
And it's time for a new story to begin!

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:17.630
Oh, crap!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:20.130
What is that thing?

00:22:27.060 --> 00:22:29.830
The first stage is now complete.

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:32.120
Alice!

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:35.990
All according to plan...
